OL,7,FEarlier Zelensky condemned Donald
OL,8,FTrump's announcement of a deal to
OL,9,Fimport Russian diesel into the US,
OL,10,Fcalling it a "gift" to President Putin
OL,12,FIn return, Trump - who is under
